 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** A set of tetrahedra defined by four vertices $(v_0, v_1, v_2, v_3)$ and a scalar value $s_i$ for each vertex. The tetrahedra must be sorted in back-to-front visibility order.
