-    *   Approximate sorting using tetrahedron centroids is commonly used for speed [S2, unofficial].
-
-2.  **Streaming:** Send the sorted tetrahedra to the graphics pipeline. If using GPU sorting, write indices directly to a VBO. If the data exceeds VBO size, read back to CPU and stream [S2, unofficial].
